      <div class="topic-title"><span class="number">07</span><div><span class="eyebrow">FENÓMENO PSICOSOCIAL</span><h2>Boreout</h2><p>Aburrimiento laboral persistente</p></div><button class="bookmark" onclick="toggleSaved(this)" aria-label="Guardar tema">☆ Guardar</button></div>
